{"id": "DeoWhN4kQ3k", "title": "Video by artandartists_ai", "description": "If your mummy calls tonight crying and asking for money… pause for one second. It might not be her. 📞\n\nA.I. can now copy anyone's voice from just a few seconds of audio: a reel, a voice note, a YouTube video. Scammers use the cloned voice to fake an emergency (accident, police, \"UPI abhi karo\") because panic stops you thinking.\n\nHow to stay safe:\n1. Agree on a secret code word that only your family knows, and ask for it on any emergency call.\n2. Hang up and call the person back on their own saved number.\n\nSend this to your family group right now. It might save someone's money. 🙏\n\n#cybersafety #scamalert #ai #voiceclone #techinhindi", "channel": "artandartists_ai", "uploader_id": "17104311819", "uploader": "Art & Artists - AI", "timestamp": 1792315403, "like_count": 12, "comment_count": 0, "http_headers": {"Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-18141395809575820a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 59.107, "asr": 48000, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.fblr2-3.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQM-bgHJgGdanZr6kNNdKia2Ysxf-iD9dS1Bnw2nTMdHlq1UiWhmgXTDyrJUuwJC5LD1jnh73vENUJpttXd2ffAIIE9l0CIjwf7jNGE.mp4?_nc_cat=110&_nc_oc=AdrZqLJU90Zqwz8Gq68iA50mVdukW0T2-drWbjXvN-WRvD-qK9V6hHiSyCsrWEm4x-tNzjWH4dVwVuoYl1PKpSNL&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=instagram.fblr2-3.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=nAXWRVnUaPEQ7kNvwHxBT8o&%3D&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=9lCwX5igyvSV2NtXW9ZVrw&_nc_ss=70689&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQQxmLIzZdBp9hj75UukN2uNkENBrIWFItpPSJttmjR-zA&oe=6AF43783", "manifest_stream_number": 0, "is_dash_periods": true, "protocol": "https", "audio_ext": "m4a", "video_ext": "none", "vbr": 0, "abr": 59.107, "resolution": "audio only", "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/151.0.0.0 Safari/537.36", "Accept": "text/html,a